The files of this directory are copied from noise-protocol 3.0.2
(https://github.com/emilbayes/noise-protocol, tag v3.0.2, commit
4a05d0b87edb8d195f1525dfdc5cc06627c857d5) and hmac-blake2b 2.0.2
(https://github.com/emilbayes/hmac-blake2b), ported to TypeScript and bound to
libsodium-wrappers-sumo (BlindVault D157, D200). Each file lists its deviations.

